00:14:42,941 --> 00:14:47,200
to wait 24 hours to undergo another QC check

314
00:14:47,201 --> 00:14:49,840
to make sure they're chemically stable

315
00:14:49,841 --> 00:14:54,880
and meet the food grade non-toxic standard.

316
00:14:54,881 --> 00:14:57,920
After that, it's time to divide the cans into sleeves,

