327
00:15:22,161 --> 00:15:24,220
When we first started, it felt like they were knocking heads,

328
00:15:24,221 --> 00:15:25,940
and that's why we started joking about having

329
00:15:25,941 --> 00:15:26,860
the Three Stooges.

330
00:15:26,861 --> 00:15:28,160
They're acting up all the time.

331
00:15:28,161 --> 00:15:29,560
I love it.

332
00:15:29,561 --> 00:15:30,740
In recent years,

333
00:15:30,741 --> 00:15:35,420
Play-Doh sales are reported to have increased 20% per year.

334
00:15:35,421 --> 00:15:37,280
To meet that rising demand,

335
00:15:37,281 --> 00:15:40,840
there are several Play-Doh factories around the globe.

