00:16:08,441 --> 00:16:10,680
So now why is this in here?

344
00:16:10,681 --> 00:16:12,720
Well, so this one was from our weigh scale.

345
00:16:12,721 --> 00:16:15,020
This one was probably only 2 and 1 half, maybe 3 ounces.

346
00:16:15,021 --> 00:16:16,680
So it didn't hit our specifications.

347
00:16:16,681 --> 00:16:18,660
So we can't go and just put that back in the hopper

348
00:16:18,661 --> 00:16:19,780
and rerun that.

349
00:16:19,781 --> 00:16:21,260
We go to a renewables company,

350
00:16:21,261 --> 00:16:23,500
and they'll create renewable energy from it.

351
00:16:23,501 --> 00:16:25,020
Is that right?

352
00:16:25,021 --> 00:16:28,700
Looking down at this glorious, colorful mass of Play-Doh,

353
00:16:28,701 --> 00:16:33,040
there's one thing I must do before I say goodbye.

