773
00:38:19,721 --> 00:38:22,720
and ultimately, the glory of endless fun.

774
00:38:22,721 --> 00:38:23,720
Oh, no!

775
00:38:23,721 --> 00:38:26,720
He just passed me. I can't believe it.

776
00:38:26,721 --> 00:38:28,720
Look at the score.

777
00:38:28,721 --> 00:38:32,720
To play with this toy is to drift into nostalgia

778
00:38:32,721 --> 00:38:37,720
that can only be created by classic toys.

779
00:38:37,721 --> 00:38:39,220
Oh, my God!

780
00:38:39,221 --> 00:38:42,020
It is as close as close can be.

781
00:38:42,021 --> 00:38:44,060
I had 7.4 million.

782
00:38:44,061 --> 00:38:46,060
He had 7.7.

783
00:38:46,061 --> 00:38:47,900
Well, thank you very much for the game

784
00:38:47,901 --> 00:38:49,900
and for the beer that I'm about to have.

785
00:38:49,901 --> 00:38:51,200
Yes, exactly.

786
00:38:51,201 --> 00:38:52,900
If I'm gonna be beaten by anybody,

787
00:38:52,901 --> 00:38:54,400
let it be by one of the greats.

788
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:59,700
Much like these exquisite pinball machines themselves,

789
00:38:59,701 --> 00:39:03,040
underneath the glittering, colorful, fantastical exterior

790
00:39:03,041 --> 00:39:06,520
of any toy lies a whole lot of intricate technology,

791
00:39:06,521 --> 00:39:09,280
incredible engineering, and a whole lot of hard work

792
00:39:09,281 --> 00:39:12,020
done by a whole lot of hard-working people.

793
00:39:12,021 --> 00:39:14,520
Like the toy engineers at Lionel Trains,

794
00:39:14,521 --> 00:39:17,060
who are using the advancements of our generation

795
00:39:17,061 --> 00:39:22,140
to take a 120-year-old classic into the 21st century.

796
00:39:22,141 --> 00:39:25,800
Or the collaborative team-up between BMC Toys

797
00:39:25,801 --> 00:39:28,880
and Northeast Plastics, who are finding new ways

798
00:39:28,881 --> 00:39:33,140
to adapt vintage mechanics so that boys and girls alike

799
00:39:33,141 --> 00:39:37,140
can enjoy recreating their own stories of heroism.

800
00:39:37,141 --> 00:39:40,140
And like the makers of Slinky,

801
00:39:40,141 --> 00:39:43,140
who are continually reimagining a coil spring

802
00:39:43,141 --> 00:39:46,140
to give it personality and life.

803
00:39:46,141 --> 00:39:49,140
Sure, we all know the value of working hard

804
00:39:49,141 --> 00:39:51,140
and handling our responsibilities,

805
00:39:51,141 --> 00:39:53,140
but it's the stuff that makes us smile

806
00:39:53,141 --> 00:39:55,140
that makes the living worthwhile.

807
00:39:55,141 --> 00:39:58,140
So go out today and make some time to go play.

808
00:39:58,141 --> 00:40:02,140
As for me, I'm gonna go buy Gary a beer.

809
00:40:02,141 --> 00:40:02,841
Beer.

